        <h2>Substitutions</h2>
        <p>Inventory moves fast, especially on a Friday. If something in your order sells out before we pack it, we'll call or text before swapping anything. You can tell us a comparable bottle, choose a refund for that item, or leave a note at checkout like "any Texas bourbon in the same range is fine" and we'll use our judgment. We don't substitute silently.</p>

        <h2>Hours: When Can You Get Delivery?</h2>
        <p>Delivery and curbside follow the store's legal hours: Monday through Saturday, 10am to 9pm. There is no Sunday delivery, because Texas liquor stores are closed on Sunday by law (more on that in our <a href="/guides/texas-liquor-laws-explained.html">Texas liquor laws guide</a>). Stores are also closed on Thanksgiving Day, Christmas Day, and New Year's Day. If you need bottles for a Sunday, order on Saturday.</p>

        <h2>How to Reach Us</h2>
        <p>Questions about an order, a bottle, or whether we carry something? Call <a href="tel:5126144949">(512) 614-4949</a> during store hours and you'll get a real person. Our <a href="/faq.html">FAQ</a> covers the most common questions, and the <a href="/delivery.html">delivery page</a> has the current terms.</p>
