        <p>That's the whole process. No app fees hidden in a menu markup, no mystery store on the other end, just a neighborhood shop that happens to come to you.</p>

        <h2>Common Questions</h2>
        <h3>Do I need to be home for alcohol delivery?</h3>
        <p>Yes. Someone 21 or older with a valid government photo ID must receive the order in person. We can't leave it unattended, and undeliverable orders return to the store.</p>
        <h3>Can I get alcohol delivered on Sunday in Austin?</h3>
        <p>No. Texas liquor stores are closed on Sunday, so delivery and curbside run Monday through Saturday, 10am to 9pm. Order Saturday if you need it Sunday.</p>
        <h3>What if something I ordered is out of stock?</h3>
        <p>We'll contact you before making any change. You can pick a substitute, take a refund on that item, or leave substitution preferences in your order notes.</p>
